-/-- A visible finite parameter is obtained from the Artin-oriented unit
-action by inverting its represented power-series unit. -/
-theorem equalCharacteristicLubinTateArtinUnitToGal_parameterUnit_inv
-    (F : LocalField.{u, v} K)
