-constant coefficient of the minimal polynomial. -/
-private theorem finiteNormExtension_abs_norm_eq_minpoly_coeff_zero_pow_relfinrank
-    {K L : Type*} [Field K] [Field L] [Algebra K L]
-    [FiniteDimensional K L]
